  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f69c6b1f1e1fc2c4b9a85c7696ada520, type: 3}
  m_Name: AfterMetro3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogSO
  replics:
  - "Asahi\u2026"
  - "Heh. What\u2019s up, barrel?"
  - "You-ugh\u2013oh! Don\u2019t call me that!"
  - "Especially here\u2026"
  - "And I told you \u2014 the bar is supposed to be a secret. And\u2026 I think\u2026
    let\u2019s go to the bar again at night. I want a drink\u2026.... "
  - "Again\u2026..."
  - "You tell me not to call you that, but fully commit to the nickname\u2026 But
    hey, listen \u2014 I took you to the bar because I thought we\u2019d have a drink\u2026
    a beer, max. "
  - You really should learn to talk about personal stuff without twenty shots in
    your system.
  - "You don\u2019t want to go to the bar with me anymore?\u2026 "
  - "I don\u2019t want to drag your drunk body across half the city again and hold
    your hair while you, uh\u2026 \u201Ctalk to the toilet.\u201D"
  - "So next time we\u2019re going to a restaurant. You like food too, don\u2019t
    you? "
  - "A restaurant? What kind of nonsense is that? I thought you took me to the bar
    because YOU wanted a drink \u2014 just not alone."
  - I took you to the bar because I wanted to actually talk to you without you running
    off behind the nearest corner after two sentences.
  - "You always have something to say\u2026 But I honestly did NOT expect what you
    said that night\u2026 hahahaha\u2026 "
  - "Listening to you talk like this, I don\u2019t even feel embarrassed\u2026"
  - "Seriously? Hearing that from you\u2026 You\u2019re gonna make me think you really
    like me. "
  - "\u2026\u2026\u2026..................."
  - "Oh wow\u2026 you didn\u2019t run away. So I was right. "
  - "Uh\u2026 eh\u2026"
  - "THAT!! DISGUSTING!! YOU\u2014 you\u2026 YOU\u2026 sound like\u2026 I DON\u2019T
    KNOW!!! "
  - "BYE! I NEED TO WORK! And you\u2014 just\u2014 go die or something\u2026 god\u2026
    horrible\u2026 I want to drink even more now\u2026 Looks like the punishment
    isn\u2019t the contract \u2014 but the squad I got with it\u2026 "
  - "Okay, yeah\u2026 mhm\u2026 So at 9 PM in the park? Yep, deal. I\u2019ll knock
    when you\u2026 \u201Ccool off.\u201D "
